elements must have an alt prop, either with meaningful text, or an empty string for decorative images.","JSXOpeningElement","jsx-a11y/anchor-is-valid","The href attribute is required for an anchor to be keyboard accessible. Provide a valid, navigable address as the href value. If you cannot provide an href, but still need the element to resemble a link, use a button and change it with appropriate styles. Learn more: https://github.com/jsx-eslint/eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y/blob/HEAD/docs/rules/anchor-is-valid.md","'axios' is defined but never used.","'openAlert' is defined but never used.","'setSettingStore' is assigned a value but never used.","React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'settingStore.value.theme'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["344"],"'matchPath' is defined but never used.","'lpWave' is defined but never used.","'siteSearch' is assigned a value but never used.","'loading' is assigned a value but never used.","'quesStBtn' is assigned a value but never used.","'closeStBtn' is assigned a value but never used.","'advanceSetting' is assigned a value but never used.","'submitSetting' is assigned a value but never used.","React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'callConfirmSetting', 'firstOpenSearch', 'id.word', and 'navigate'. Either include them or remove the dependency array.",["345"],"'addedStyles' is assigned a value but never used.","'thsl_handleDelete' is defined but never used.","The href attribute requires a valid value to be accessible. Provide a valid, navigable address as the href value. If you cannot provide a valid href, but still need the element to resemble a link, use a button and change it with appropriate styles. Learn more: https://github.com/jsx-eslint/eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y/blob/HEAD/docs/rules/anchor-is-valid.md","'adAdmin' is defined but never used.","'adMain' is defined but never used.","'adSidebar' is defined but never used.",["346"],"'data' is defined but never used.","'have4Learn' is assigned a value but never used.","Assignments to the 'searchId' variable from inside React Hook useEffect will be lost after each render. To preserve the value over time, store it in a useRef Hook and keep the mutable value in the '.current' property. Otherwise, you can move this variable directly inside useEffect.","CallExpression","Assignments to the 'limit4Learn' variable from inside React Hook useEffect will be lost after each render. To preserve the value over time, store it in a useRef Hook and keep the mutable value in the '.current' property. Otherwise, you can move this variable directly inside useEffect.","jsx-a11y/no-redundant-roles","The element button has an implicit role of button. Defining this explicitly is redundant and should be avoided.","no-useless-concat","Unexpected string concatenation of literals.","unexpectedConcat","'keys' is assigned a value but never used.",{"desc":"347","fix":"348"},{"desc":"349","fix":"350"},{"desc":"351","fix":"352"},{"desc":"351","fix":"353"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [authToken, projects]",{"range":"354","text":"355"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [authToken, settingStore.value.theme]",{"range":"356","text":"357"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [authToken, callConfirmSetting, firstOpenSearch, id.word, location, navigate]",{"range":"358","text":"359"},{"range":"360","text":"359"},[6279,6290],"[authToken, projects]",[2100,2111],"[authToken, settingStore.value.theme]",[20117,20138],"[authToken, callConfirmSetting, firstOpenSearch, id.word, location, navigate]",[19546,19567]]